	"descriptionMarkdown": "<p>A mid-game ship for the inner planets, built with Vulcanus and Gleba tech.</p>\n\n<p>For flights between [space-location=nauvis] Nauvis, [space-location=vulcanus] Vulcanus, [space-location=gleba] Gleba and [space-location=fulgora] Fulgora.</p>\n\n<p><b>How to use it:</b> give the ship a single station, the planet it serves (Nauvis in the picture, with unloading on). In the hub, add one logistic group per planet, for example \"Vulcanus to Nauvis\" with its items imported from Vulcanus. When one of them runs out, the ship's interrupts send it to that planet until all requests are satisfied (or 2 minutes), then it flies back and unloads. Use the same logistic groups on the cargo landing pad of the planet it serves, so the pad and the ship always ask for the same items.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/3CDKyUy\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:8px 18px;background:#2b7de9;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none\">📷 See the schedule and requests setup</a></p>\n\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>[item=thruster] <b>Nonstop:</b> ~200 km/s with no waiting for ammo from physical damage 9 on.</li>\n  <li>[item=cargo-bay] <b>Cargo:</b> the ship keeps its ammo and plates on its belt, so the hub's 99 slots stay free for cargo. An alert shows when the hub is almost full.</li>\n  <li>[item=space-platform-hub] <b>Interrupt schedule:</b> request an item from a planet in the hub and the ship flies there to pick it up.</li>\n  <li>[item=firearm-magazine] <b>Ammo safety:</b> below 100 magazines the ship crawls until it has 300 again, instead of taking damage.</li>\n  <li>[item=crusher] <b>Any asteroid productivity:</b> the crushers balance themselves, tested from 0 to +300%.</li>\n  <li>[item=solar-panel] <b>Power:</b> solar only, safe to park at any inner planet.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>[item=foundry] Vulcanus and Gleba tech (foundry, asteroid reprocessing, advanced asteroid processing, stack inserter). Build it in Nauvis orbit.</li>\n  <li>[item=automation-science-pack] Research: weapon shooting speed 6, inserter capacity bonus 7, physical damage 6 (9 for nonstop).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Specs and stats</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>[item=space-platform-foundation] <b>Size:</b> 1,106 tiles, 261 t, 5 thrusters, 12 gun turrets, 2 cargo bays.</li>\n  <li>[item=gun-turret] <b>Reliability:</b> tested to take no damage with the research above, in flight and parked.</li>\n  <li>[item=firearm-magazine] <b>Time spent crawling:</b> none at physical damage 9, 1 to 5% at 8, 20 to 30% at 7, 35 to 45% at 6.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Release notes</h3>\n<p><b>2026-11-03: First release</b></p>\n",
